Had a promising Sammie going - first level found some a second rustproof
splint mail, and a key.  Second and third levels were fairly
inconsequential, and on the fourth level there was a co-aligned altar
and the entrance to minetown. I begin my descent to the mines and get
my longsword skill bumped up a slot by the time I hit minetown.

In minetown, Izchak had a magic lamp as well as the hardware store, so
I'm fairly happy. Use one wish on +3B Grayswandir, and actually manage
to get it. Silver saber is quickly bumped up to basic, and I manage to
find a plethora of scrolls and a magic marker. Also managed to get my
second magic lamp uncursed, but I held it back as a permanent light
source - I had a feeling about this guy and I knew that I'd get more
wishes through the castle.

By the time I make it through Sokoban, I'm level 12, I have my longsword
maxed, and have bumped up twoweapon one slot. Sokoban had "oReflection,
which was somewhat dissapointing, just because the mines didn't have a
BoH and I hadn't seen one to yet. Manage to grab a unihorn and a couple
of waters, and bless a few items. Grayswandir gets bumped up to +5, and
the katana is now rustproofed and +3.

I was still at level 12 by the time I found the Quest teleport, so I
decended fairly uneventfully to about level 20 - I did manage to get an
elven helm to +5, and a CoInvisibility up to +1, but everything else was
seriously basic. Found a barracks that was pretty standard, a disgusting
nest that had no eggs, and a few treasure zoos. Chatted with a priest
for a while and got a +5 natural AC boost after liberating some gold out
of a vault or three while looking for Ludios (still had some blank
scrolls and a charged magic marker, and was completely drooling for a
DSM). Also managed to get some intrinsics from various jellies, blobs
and others, so I'm feeling pretty good.

Cruise down to Medusa's with no other vaults jumping out, so I begin
backtracking just to make sure. Upon revisiting level 20, much to my
glee, I run into girl I used to date (she ended up going to medical
school after we broke up, but thats a different story). Turns out she's
still pissed at me, so she starts smacking me around a bit. Undeterred,
I think of old times and get nekkid, managing to milk a few hp from her
before she takes off.

Now, the thought of me running naked through a dungeon is frightening at
best, but since I catch a glimpse of my former ladyfriend just around
the corner, off I go, hotfooting it down a hall in the buff. I try to
calm her down again, and I manage to even get a few points before we're
rudely interrupted - I take a step or two back from her, rearm myself
and deal with the unwanted intruder (a giant no less, so at least I got
a nice snack out of all of this). By now, she's long gone again.

I get dressed and track her down to yet another room and corner her far
away from the (doorless) door. Back to my old games, I strip down and
try coaxing her into the horizontal for at least a little while. Of
course, that just upsets her more, but such is life. With a little bit
of smooth talking, I finally score a few more points back, and am just
about to achieve my moment of glory....

Another interruption.

Aww, its just a lil' killer bee, what harm could it do? I guess I should
